    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63248" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λικμ-άω</span></b> , fut. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ήσω</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			X.
			<u>Oec.</u>
			18.8
		</span></i>: aor.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλίκμησα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					B.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					34
				</span></i>
			:— <i>part the grain from the chaff, winnow</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνδρῶν λικμώντων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.500
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σῖτον λ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Oec.</u>
					18.6
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καρπὸν ἀπ᾽ ἀσταχύων</span>
			B.l.c.: metaph., <i>scatter like chaff</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ez.</u>
				29.12
			</span></i>; <i>make away with</i>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Is.</u>
				30.22
			</span></i>; <i>crush, destroy</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλίκμησάν μου τὸ λάχανον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BGU</u>
					146.8
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A.D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφ᾽ ὃν δ᾽ ἂν
				πέσῃ</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ λίθος</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> λικμήσει αὐτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Ev.Luc.</u>
					20.18
				</span></i>
			.</div>
